Description: Bilibili iOS 13 danmaku 120Hz + normal-speed motion. Keeps matched danmaku display links at 120Hz while clamping likely danmaku clock/renderer playback speed above 1x back to 1x, so 2x/3x video can keep smoother but readable 1x danmaku movement. Includes runtime diagnostics.
